## Command Summary

### Inline Commands

| Command | Syntax | Description |
|---------|--------|-------------|
| **Execute** | `command` {{ execute }} | Run shell command |
| **Execute (terminal)** | `command` {{ execute 't2' }} | Run in specific terminal |
| **Interrupt** | `command` {{ execute interrupt }} | Interrupt and run command |
| **Copy** | `text` {{ copy }} | Copy to clipboard |
| **Open** | `./path/file` {{ open }} | Open file in editor |

### Block Commands

| Command | Syntax | Description |
|---------|--------|-------------|
| **Block Execute** | ```{{ execute }}``` | Run all commands in block with "Run All" button |
| **Block Execute (lang)** | ```python{{ execute }}``` | Execute with syntax highlighting |
| **Block Execute (terminal)** | ```{{ execute 'name' }}``` | Run block in specific terminal |
| **Block Execute (interrupt)** | ```{{ execute interrupt }}``` | Interrupt and run block |
| **Block Copy** | ```{{ copy }}``` | Copy all lines with "Copy All" button |
| **Block Copy (lang)** | ```javascript{{ copy }}``` | Copy with syntax highlighting |
| **Block Open** | ```{{ open }}``` | Open all files with "Open All" button |

### Admonitions

| Command | Syntax | Description |
|---------|--------|-------------|
| **Note** | `text` {{ note }} | General information |
| **Info** | `text` {{ info }} | Technical details |
| **Tip/Hint** | `text` {{ tip }} / {{ hint }} | Best practices |
| **Warning** | `text` {{ warning }} | Important cautions |
| **Danger** | `text` {{ danger }} | Critical alerts |

### Quiz System

| Command | Syntax | Description |
|---------|--------|-------------|
| **Quiz (block)** | ```quiz id="x"``` | Multi-line quiz question |
| **Quiz (block w/ key)** | ```quiz id="x" answerKey="file"``` | Quiz with custom answer key |
| **Quiz (inline)** | `question` {{ quiz id="x" }} | Single-line quiz |
| **Quiz (inline w/ key)** | `question` {{ quiz id="x" answerKey="file" }} | Inline quiz with custom key |

